<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Update on your store application</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .reason-box { background: #fff8f0; border-left: 4px solid #c8a882; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 Daily Daisy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Update on your application, {{firstName}}</h2>
      <p>Thank you for your interest in selling on Daily Daisy. After reviewing your application for <strong>{{storeName}}</strong>, we're unable to approve it at this time.</p>
      <div class="reason-box">
        <p><strong>Reason:</strong></p>
        <p>{{reason}}</p>
      </div>
      <p>If you believe this decision was made in error or you'd like to reapply in the future, please contact our support team.</p>
      <p>Warmly,<br /><strong>The Daily Daisy Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} Daily Daisy. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
